Verify and atomically install an independently signed JSON grant

Usage: cs harvest-authority import [OPTIONS] --molecule <MOLECULE> --file <FILE>

Options:
      --config <PATH>        Path to configuration file
      --molecule <MOLECULE>  Molecule whose current facts the grant must cover
      --file <FILE>          JSON file holding a `DoneAuthorization`
  -v, --verbose              Enable verbose output
      --json                 Output in JSON format
  -h, --help                 Print help
